  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc1/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. Reviewed 2026-11-01 on dev 100b6fbb6e. format_tiered_behavior_map still filters with is_excluded_kind + is_external_boundary (compact.py:1953-1959) and calls select_by_connectivity without seed_eligible (L1977), with confidence>=0.7 entrypoint seeds; the compact default passes seed_eligible=is_key_symbol (L1492). select_by_tokens has no production caller (only its def and tests/test_compact.py; the docstring says so since c970d55e05), so only the tiered half is a live question. MECHANISM: tiered view filters with is_excluded_kind and calls select_by_connectivity without seed_eligible=is_key_symbol."  # cd9b
